    "html": "<p class=\"build-note\" data-i18n=\"查看已保存场景的静态布局，无需构建或安装运行引擎。移动、输入和状态变化请使用运行测试。\">查看已保存场景的静态布局，无需构建或安装运行引擎。移动、输入和状态变化请使用运行测试。</p>\n    <p id=\"scenePreviewDraft\" class=\"build-hint\" hidden=\"\" data-i18n=\"存在未保存草稿；预览仍使用上次保存的场景和投影。\">存在未保存草稿；预览仍使用上次保存的场景和投影。</p>\n    <div class=\"scene-preview-toolbar\"><button id=\"scenePreviewRefresh\" type=\"button\" class=\"doc-btn\" data-i18n=\"刷新场景预览\">刷新场景预览</button>\n    <button id=\"scenePreviewFit\" type=\"button\" class=\"doc-btn doc-btn-ghost\" data-i18n=\"适应画布\">适应画布</button>\n    <button id=\"scenePreviewZoomOut\" type=\"button\" class=\"doc-btn doc-btn-ghost\" data-i18n=\"缩小\">缩小</button>\n    <output id=\"scenePreviewZoom\" aria-live=\"off\">90%</output>\n    <button id=\"scenePreviewZoomIn\" type=\"button\" class=\"doc-btn doc-btn-ghost\" data-i18n=\"放大\">放大</button>\n    <label class=\"scene-preview-grid\"><input id=\"scenePreviewGrid\" type=\"checkbox\"><span data-i18n=\"显示网格\">显示网格</span></label></div>\n    <p id=\"scenePreviewMessage\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">已载入保存时的布局。修改场景或投影后，刷新预览查看变化。</p>\n    <p id=\"scenePreviewSummary\" class=\"build-hint\">640 × 480 · 2 个角色 · 快照：sha256:d42f419a423b68f3b14fc0d72353d60e75557c7966818196f1c1eb10c1f45b87</p>\n    <p class=\"build-hint\" id=\"scenePreviewHelp\" data-i18n=\"点击角色查看属性；拖动画布平移，滚轮缩放。画布聚焦后可用方向键平移、加减键缩放、0 适应画布。\">点击角色查看属性；拖动画布平移，滚轮缩放。画布聚焦后可用方向键平移、加减键缩放、0 适应画布。</p>\n    <div class=\"scene-preview-layout\"><canvas id=\"scenePreviewCanvas\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-describedby=\"scenePreviewHelp\" data-i18n-aria-label=\"已保存的二维场景预览\" aria-label=\"已保存的二维场景预览\" width=\"649\" height=\"479\"></canvas>\n    <aside><h3 data-i18n=\"场景对象\">场景对象</h3><ol id=\"scenePreviewObjects\"><li class=\"\"><button class=\"doc-btn doc-btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" data-object-id=\"55bed9a0-1363-46b7-9528-1fc818ff0977\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Traveler · Player</button></li><li class=\"\"><button class=\"doc-btn doc-btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" data-object-id=\"5c850470-3cae-40bc-b325-ab05cd15e0d7\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Traveler · NPC</button></li></ol><p id=\"scenePreviewSelection\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">从画布或对象列表选择角色。</p>\n    <section id=\"scenePreviewInspector\" aria-labelledby=\"scenePreviewInspectorTitle\" hidden=\"\"><h3 id=\"scenePreviewInspectorTitle\" data-i18n=\"对象属性\">对象属性</h3><div id=\"scenePreviewProperties\"></div></section></aside></div>\n    <div class=\"scene-preview-toolbar\"><button id=\"scenePreviewEdit\" type=\"button\" class=\"doc-btn\" data-i18n=\"编辑场景\">编辑场景</button>\n    <button id=\"scenePreviewSource\" type=\"button\" class=\"doc-btn doc-btn-ghost\" data-i18n=\"打开场景原文\">打开场景原文</button></div>\n    <ul id=\"scenePreviewDiagnostics\" class=\"scene-diagnostics\"></ul>"
